theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 8
text = "Dear customer, 

Congratulations! On your acceptance into the Animal Diversity Repopulation Program. 

You may have never heard of an animal but now that can change. Here at Tardigate our scientists have been busy at work recreating animal species based on loose knowledge of animals in the ancient world. Called Yips!

Your job is simple, find Yips and encourage reproduction! Under no circumstances are you allowed to perform blood sports with your Yips.

Sincerely, Bob Gate.
"
